# To use Gemini, paste your API key here and copy this file to ".env":
#   cp .env.example .env
# A key can be created for free at Google AI Studio (https://aistudio.google.com/apikey).
#
# ★ A key is optional: without one it runs on mock responses, so the hands-on still works.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# (Optional) Pin the models to use. Comma-separated, tried top to bottom.
# If unset, it tries the defaults (gemini-3.5-flash -> gemini-3-flash-preview -> gemini-flash-latest),
# and if all fail it auto-discovers the models actually usable with your key and retries.
# See the usable names after startup with:  curl http://localhost:8000/api/ai/health
# GEMINI_MODELS=gemini-3.5-flash,gemini-3-flash-preview
